{"id":"concurrente.canales.canal-tabla","lesson":"concurrente.canales","kind":"rastrear","level":"brote","required":false,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"Trace the consumer"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete the table of the task that adds: the message received and the total, one row per message."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[],"variant":[],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Each message is added to the total: 4, then 4 + 5 = 9 and finally 9 + 6 = 15. The messages arrive in the order they were sent."}]}],"program":{"id":"traza","title":"","source":"SubProceso Suspendible Produce(queue Como Canal<Entero>)\n  Para latest <- 4 Hasta 6 Hacer\n    Definir accepted Como Logico <- Aguardar queue.Enviar(latest);\n    Si No accepted Entonces\n      Escribir \"channel closed\";\n    FinSi\n  FinPara\n  queue.Cerrar();\nFinSubProceso\n\nSubProceso Suspendible AddUp(queue Como Canal<Entero>)\n  Definir total Como Entero <- 0;\n  Definir latest Como Entero <- 0;\n  Repetir\n    Segun Aguardar queue.Recibir() Hacer\n      Algo(received):\n        latest <- received;\n        total <- total + latest;\n      Nada: Salir;\n    FinSegun\n  Hasta Que Falso\n  Escribir total;\nFinSubProceso\n\nAlgoritmo ChannelSum\n  Definir queue Como Canal<Entero> <- Canal(2);\n  Tareas\n    Lanzar Produce(queue);\n    Lanzar AddUp(queue);\n  FinTareas\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["SubProceso","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["Suspendible","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Produce","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["queue","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Canal","type"],["<","operator"],["Entero","type"],[">","operator"],[")","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Para","keywordStructured"],[" "],["latest","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["4","literalNumber"],[" "],["Hasta","keywordStructured"],[" "],["6","literalNumber"],[" "],["Hacer","keywordStructured"]],[["    "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["accepted","ide